  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What stands out",
     "texto": [
      "To highlight something and say «precisely…» or «just…», use **N(이)야말로**: 지금**이야말로** 기회예요 = right now precisely is the opportunity. 너**야말로** 내 친구야 = you precisely are my friend."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Intensifying with a negation",
     "texto": [
      "**여간 A-(으)ㄴ 것이 아니다 / V-는 것이 아니다** and **여간 A/V-지 않다** express that something is not of little intensity: **여간 힘들지 않아요** = it is very hard; **여간 힘든 일이 아니에요** = it is a tremendously hard job.",
      "It is an emphatic expression, common in careful registers; it should not be read as a literal negation of «difficult»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
